For this task, I created an infographic on the topic of digital literacy using Canva. The aim was to present important information in a simple and visually appealing way.

In my infographic, I included key aspects such as the meaning of digital literacy, useful digital tools for students, safe internet practices, and email etiquette. I focused on keeping the content short and clear so that it is easy to understand at a glance.

While designing, I explored different layouts and icons to make the infographic look neat and engaging. One challenge I faced was fitting all the important points into a single page without making it look crowded. However, I managed this by using brief points and proper spacing.

Overall, this task helped me understand the importance of digital literacy and how it plays a major role in academic and everyday life. It also improved my design and presentation skills.

